# Runtime state: a zone rewrites this as people play, so tracking it means
# every playtest dirties the tree. The calibrated ladder.json is tracked; the
# live ratings are not.
#
# Unanchored, so it catches the copy a server writes wherever it is started
# from. The rule used to name zone/ only, and the root one got committed by
# somebody running the server from the repo root -- after which every test run
# rewrote a tracked file, and one of mine dropped a bot from the ladder
# entirely before I noticed.
ratings.json
# Secrets and per-host state for a deployment: generated, never committed.
deploy/.env
deploy/deploy-log/
sandbox-ca.crt

# The generator is run by hand; its bytecode cache is not ours to keep.
client/tools/__pycache__/
tools/pilot/libvwprobe.so

# The identity a running arena writes for itself, per host, not per repo.
zone/instance-id

# The browser bundle. Built and published by CI as an image
# (.github/workflows/client.yml), not committed: it was 5 MB of git history per
# release and a step somebody had to remember, and forgetting it cost an outage.
client/dist/
